 / oxidizer bags`,weightLbs:40,note:`Labeled oxidizer bags, split from acid. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`skimmer-baskets`,name:`Skimmer / pump baskets`,weightLbs:6,note:`Replacement baskets for route swaps. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`spare-pool-pump`,name:`Spare circulator pump`,weightLbs:38,note:`Common swap pump on the truck. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`heater-parts`,name:`Heater / salt-cell service parts`,weightLbs:16,note:`Igniters, sensors, and a spare salt cell. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`tile-acid-kit`,name:`Tile / acid-wash kit (labeled, split)`,weightLbs:18,note:`Acid kept in separate containment from oxidizers. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`o-ring-parts-bin`,name:`O-rings / lids / fittings bin`,weightLbs:10,note:`Pump lids, o-rings, and unions. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`vacuum-cart`,name:`Vacuum cart / caddy`,weightLbs:22,note:`Wheeled caddy for hose and head. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`})],Te=[M({id:`battery-mower`,name:`Walk-behind battery mower (EGO 21 in LM2135SP)`,weightLbs:T,weightSource:`fact`,note:`EGO LM2135SP — 62.5 lb. Biggest landscape payload with the battery bank and trailer GVWR.`}),M({id:`lawn-pack-chargers`,name:`Battery mower pack chargers`,watts:1800,typicalHours:3,weightLbs:18,note:`Shop or trailer-mounted mower chargers drawing from the truck`}),M({id:`ope-hand-chargers`,name:`Hand-tool chargers (blower / trimmer / edger packs)`,watts:400,typicalHours:2.5,weightLbs:12,note:`Handheld outdoor-power pack chargers`}),M({id:`extra-battery-packs`,name:`Battery bank (8 × EGO 56V 10Ah BA5600T)`,weightLbs:E,weightSource:`fact`,note:`8 × 7.72 lb EGO BA5600T = ${E} lb. Swap packs for a full crew day.`}),M({id:`handheld-ope-kit`,name:`Blowers / trimmers / edgers`,weightLbs:55,note:`Kit presence for handheld OPE on the truck or trailer. Weight is a Sep 2026 estimate.`}),M({id:`crew-trailer`,name:`Crew trailer (2,990 lb GVWR, loaded)`,trailerWeightLbs:j,weightLbs:40,